  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tailor-made training alumni Social Affairs &amp; Employment 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The tailor-made training with the theme &quot;Social Affairs &amp; Employment in the Middle East and Northern Africa (MENA) region&quot; contributes to increasing the knowledge of the alumni in the field of social affairs and employment. The knowledge will enable them to (better) guide reforms/developments in the field of social affairs and employment in their own country (change agent).In addition, the goal of the event is to strengthen the relation with the alumni of the Shiraka Training Programme (STP) training &apos;Social Affairs &amp; Employment&apos; 2020 (ambassador of the Netherlands).RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country has been included in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
